Petal is a modified version of Tulip (https://github.com/OpenAttackDefenseTools/tulip),
written by RickdeJager, Bazumo and contributors (Team Europe / OpenAttackDefenseTools),
which is itself based on flower (https://github.com/secgroup/flower) by secgroup (Ca' Foscari).

Modified by aimansam starting November 2026: renamed to Petal; added setup.sh, the capture
container, Docker-hosted service detection and multi-network capture, dashboard IP/port
selection, and attacker IP (src:<ip>) tagging. The full change history is in the git log.

